        "prompt": "$\\tan\\theta=\\tan70^{\\circ}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=70^{\\circ},\\ 250^{\\circ}$",
          "worked": "The related angle is $70^{\\circ}$. Tangent is positive in quadrants 1 and 3.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta &= 70^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 180^{\\circ}+70^{\\circ}=250^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 70^{\\circ},\\ 250^{\\circ}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-question-28-31-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\sin\\theta=\\sin110^{\\circ}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=70^{\\circ},\\ 110^{\\circ}$",
          "worked": "The related angle is $180^{\\circ}-110^{\\circ}=70^{\\circ}$. Sine is positive in quadrants 1 and 2.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta &= 70^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 180^{\\circ}-70^{\\circ}=110^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 70^{\\circ},\\ 110^{\\circ}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-question-28-31-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\cos\\theta=\\cos230^{\\circ}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=130^{\\circ},\\ 230^{\\circ}$",
          "worked": "The related angle is $230^{\\circ}-180^{\\circ}=50^{\\circ}$. Cosine is negative in quadrants 2 and 3.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta &= 180^{\\circ}-50^{\\circ}=130^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 180^{\\circ}+50^{\\circ}=230^{\\circ}\\\\\\theta &= 130^{\\circ},\\ 230^{\\circ}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-question-28-31-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\tan\\theta=\\tan345^{\\circ}$",
